          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Werner Heisenberg</strong><br>\nWerner Heisenberg was born on December 5, 1901, in Würzburg, Germany. He grew up in a family where education was highly valued, with his father being a professor at the University of Munich. As a young boy, Heisenberg was fascinated by mathematics and science, which set the path for his future academic pursuits. He excelled in his studies and developed an interest in theoretical physics, a field that was rapidly evolving at the time.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Quantum Mechanics</strong><br>\nHeisenberg began his university studies at the University of Munich, where he was influenced by some of the most prominent physicists of the time, including Arnold Sommerfeld. In 1923, he received his PhD from the University of Munich. His work was critical to the development of quantum mechanics, which challenged traditional views on how subatomic particles behave. Heisenberg's uncertainty principle, introduced in 1927, was a groundbreaking concept in this field.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Uncertainty Principle</strong><br>\nThe uncertainty principle proposed that it is impossible to determine simultaneously both the position and velocity of an electron or any other particle with high accuracy. This idea was controversial because it contradicted the previously accepted Newtonian physics. Heisenberg's principle played a vital role in the broader acceptance and development of quantum mechanics, providing a new lens through which to understand the physical world.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
